@node hack_terminal
@meta
pool: camp_actions
label: "Do some hacking (-{.energy_cost} energy)"
label_unavailable: "Do some hacking (needs {.energy_cost} energy)"
label_teaser: "A terminal blinks in the dark"
when: $found_terminal
available: $energy >= .energy_cost
@endmeta
You crack the terminal.
@endnode
